{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>T1傳奇選手Faker聯手aespa KARINA拍網遊廣告！Faker展現大魔王神反應，竟爆笑「救機不救美」任由女神跌倒，惹怒KARINA瘋狂追打。即看破天荒跨界合作詳情！</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1132041520187183104586109.jpeg/EelS-hDiTv5aWVs2_87b-RhFqsNXvOUREWe87BFnvOw\" alt=\"係女團aespa成員的KARINA（劉知珉）！（YouTube截圖）\"><figcaption>係女團aespa成員的KARINA（劉知珉）！（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1132041522586456064479263.jpeg/fj9jkNyxLx-73sIpLOE5NxF6nyD51LheDpy4ig6cuIo\" alt=\"係女團aespa成員的KARINA（劉知珉）！（YouTube截圖）\"><figcaption>係女團aespa成員的KARINA（劉知珉）！（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1132041524935397376623057.jpeg/upZZC-ELOPDvjvPE4zlJryj_Nd_4xgrNaOt92mjrfdo\" alt=\"韓國Faker。（YouTube截圖）\"><figcaption>韓國Faker。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1132041527246589952075132.jpeg/NOwSteL_-IaMVSBUYm1No-h_Rv5X7scPPs0ZxT7NGcU\" alt=\"正常人一定以為Faker衝去救KARINA。（YouTube截圖）\"><figcaption>正常人一定以為Faker衝去救KARINA。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>爆笑反轉劇情：大魔王發揮神反應竟「只救手機」</p><p>這一連串的廣告並不走尋常風，而是帶有喜劇元素的愛情故事。第一集講一位男性拿着手機邊走邊看電話走出車廂，正好與KARINA走入時碰到，手機隨之跌下，而KARINA亦失平衡快到跌倒。</p><p>KARINA暴走追打Faker</p><p>在電光火石之際，看到情況的Faker以其快捷的反應，一個滾地衝到KARINA跟前⋯⋯但並不是「英雄救美」，而是英雄救「機」接過了電話再交還給那位路人甲。最後畫面看到KARINA追着Faker喊打，十分之搞笑。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1132041618094821376492678.jpeg/GAhhoDCzTo5_afMAGUxhenUSZfyRr1V--stdDPrLXQw\" alt=\"仲要打個筋斗。（YouTube截圖）\"><figcaption>仲要打個筋斗。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1132041620506677248938675.jpeg/ozDEuHaZWDt7Kema2WPaDmmNBHHKrFUx55_81uef_NY\" alt=\"就嚟救到！（YouTube截圖）\"><figcaption>就嚟救到！（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1132041622985641984467382.jpeg/-fP8xYgnxhfTBnmZvh9BWLj9jvm9UFHzRGf0sERn9LA\" alt=\"點知係接住部電話！（YouTube截圖）\"><figcaption>點知係接住部電話！（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1132041625313611776094518.jpeg/BBVGNO7SFOn6UC4GUu-Xw6crObrnh1ShnZByaZ2Qcmk\" alt=\"之後先扶KARINA起身。（YouTube截圖）\"><figcaption>之後先扶KARINA起身。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1132041628207812608781254.jpeg/NZnVARMMNRDoVqq7RZmNZlnm9GAUCcTcTf_4K03_-Cs\" alt=\"之後先扶KARINA起身。（YouTube截圖）\"><figcaption>之後先扶KARINA起身。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260515/1132041618979819520497120.jpeg/J6liWGIlWnpWBm_r__RJB-8ntKyXQjYsEqTTqRKk06k\" alt=\"Faker俾KARINA追打。（YouTube截圖）\"><figcaption>Faker俾KARINA追打。（YouTube截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-16T14:26:57.823759+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":579,"images":10,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}